  "notes": {
    "title": "Combat and build rework",
    "summary": "Reworked weapon combat, class starts and build upgrades, with weapon drops that better reflect your build. Navigation now does less repeated work in crowded fights.",
    "changes": [
      "Added class-specific starter choices with a core skill and matching weapon. Weapon enhancers now combine on the original autoattack in configured order, with shared action-level mana budgets.",
      "Raised Heavy Strike to 1,000% attack and added Focused Discharge (+60% direct Lightning Strike damage). Reverberation offers now consider effective lightning sources, including Storm Cabinet, while remaining available without one.",
      "Weapon drops and merchants now roll a weapon family before a specific weapon. Matching skills provide the main weighting bonus, capped at 2x; other weapon families remain available.",
      "Skill maps now distinguish prerequisites, upgrades, synergies, alternatives and exclusions. Added 24 build-direction presets; compatible upgrades can be combined instead of treated as exclusive forms.",
      "Reduced repeated collision and pathfinding work in crowded fights. Blocked actors wait briefly before retrying instead of continuously searching for another attack position. Added a persistent 60/120 FPS setting, with 120 FPS as the default."
    ]
  }
}